WEBVTT

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:04.230
<i>My name is Hiiragi Seiichi. 
I'm a second-year in high school.</i>

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:08.610
<i>One day, I was sent to another 
world that isn't Earth.</i>

00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:10.980
<i>There, I ate some Fruit of Evolution,</i>

00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:13.240
<i>and gained an OP physique 
while still Level 1!</i>

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:16.030
<i>On top of that, a gorilla named Saria...</i>

00:00:16.030 --> 00:00:18.180
<i>evolved into a beautiful woman?!</i>

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:20.530
<i>A super cute one, too!</i>

00:00:20.530 --> 00:00:22.280
<i>We left the forest together,</i>

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:26.090
<i>but what's gonna happen to 
my life in another world?!</i>

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:33.420
We should head for the 
nearest town first, right?

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:34.190
Yeah.

00:00:34.190 --> 00:00:38.800
Once we register at an adventurer's guild 
there, we'll get proof of identification.

00:00:40.310 --> 00:00:41.410
<i>That should also</i>

00:00:41.410 --> 00:00:44.810
<i>give me a chance to meet up with 
Kannazuki-senpai and the others.</i>

00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:51.070
Jiggle!

00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:52.580
How cute!

00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:54.570
This is a slime?!

00:00:58.260 --> 00:00:59.450
Appraise!

00:00:59.830 --> 00:01:02.080
It's Level 88?!

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:05.270
Slimes are the weakest of 
weak mobs, aren't they?

00:01:05.270 --> 00:01:07.080
That's too strong!

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:09.090
Jiggle!

00:01:09.090 --> 00:01:09.710
It's fast!

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:13.460
So this is the Sixth Sense skill?

00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:20.220
Take this!

00:01:25.430 --> 00:01:27.420
Wow, amazing!

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:29.260
You really are strong!

00:01:29.260 --> 00:01:31.440
A-Am I...

00:01:31.970 --> 00:01:34.210
some kind of monster now?!

00:01:35.210 --> 00:01:37.150
Seiichi, what's that?

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:39.410
Boots and cards?

00:01:40.020 --> 00:01:41.860
You can wear the boots, Saria.

00:01:43.030 --> 00:01:45.070
Thanks, Seiichi.

00:01:45.070 --> 00:01:46.660
I'll take these.

00:01:49.780 --> 00:01:53.420
<i>Skills: Absorb and Compress acquired.</i>

00:01:54.820 --> 00:01:56.200
<i>You have leveled up.</i>

00:01:56.200 --> 00:02:00.380
<i>Skill: Disguise has ranked 
up to Disguise Prowess.</i>

00:02:00.380 --> 00:02:04.820
Crap! I'm becoming even more of a monster!

00:02:05.430 --> 00:02:06.650
Huh?

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:07.940
So bright!

00:02:07.940 --> 00:02:08.670
Hey!

00:02:08.670 --> 00:02:11.440
My eyes! My eyes!

00:02:19.040 --> 00:02:20.950
It turned into a robe?

00:02:22.860 --> 00:02:24.450
This just fell.

00:02:25.390 --> 00:02:26.450
A letter?

00:02:27.590 --> 00:02:29.460
Hello! Mister Sheep here.

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:30.960
It was your doing?!

00:02:31.180 --> 00:02:33.770
Congratulations on leveling up!

00:02:33.770 --> 00:02:37.360
You're steadily leaving humanity behind.

00:02:37.360 --> 00:02:38.220
Shut up!

00:02:39.210 --> 00:02:43.090
Now, your helmet suddenly 
transformed into a robe, did it not?

00:02:43.090 --> 00:02:46.030
This is because it evolved with you.

00:02:46.030 --> 00:02:47.470
It evolved?!

00:02:47.470 --> 00:02:51.520
Your Skill, Disguise, has leveled up!

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:56.960
Thanks to that, you won't have everyone 
finding out how monstrously strong you are.

00:02:56.960 --> 00:03:01.050
Which means there's no longer 
any need to conceal your face,

00:03:01.050 --> 00:03:04.490
so it transformed into a common robe.

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:06.200
That's a long explanation!

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:08.500
But this is great, Seiichi!

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:12.020
Also, this letter will 
automatically self-destruct.

00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:12.270
Huh?

00:03:12.270 --> 00:03:13.250
Kaboom!

00:03:13.520 --> 00:03:14.500
Seiichi!

00:03:16.600 --> 00:03:18.260
Screw you!

00:03:20.160 --> 00:03:24.260
It's my first time wearing shoes. 
How do they look?

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:27.000
Yeah, you look really good in them.

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:29.830
I'm so happy!

00:03:30.260 --> 00:03:34.070
<i>So, once again, we began 
walking toward a town.</i>

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:44.200
<b>The Fruit of Evolution:</b>

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:44.200
<b>\h\hBefore I Knew It,

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:10.030
<b>Artoria, The Calamity</b>

00:05:08.950 --> 00:05:11.700
What? You don't have any 
proof of identification?

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:13.910
That's impossible.

00:05:13.910 --> 00:05:15.860
Even slaves have that.

00:05:15.860 --> 00:05:17.490
Right...

00:05:17.490 --> 00:05:19.210
But we lost ours.

00:05:19.210 --> 00:05:20.720
Oh, well, then.

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:24.620
Both of you, go ahead and 
place your hands on this.

00:05:24.620 --> 00:05:27.040
This is the Gem of Truth,

00:05:27.040 --> 00:05:30.220
an item that identifies the 
criminality of those who touch it.

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:31.490
<i>Oh, no.</i>

00:05:31.490 --> 00:05:34.070
<i>I'm using Disguise, but that'll 
be meaningless, won't it?</i>

00:05:36.550 --> 00:05:38.470
Good, you pass!

00:05:38.470 --> 00:05:40.230
Next up is the beauty.

00:05:43.950 --> 00:05:45.950
You're both good to go in.

00:05:45.950 --> 00:05:47.800
We did it, Seiichi!

00:05:47.800 --> 00:05:51.490
But you should get your proof of 
identification made as soon as possible.

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:52.680
Right.

00:05:52.680 --> 00:05:55.500
We're going to have the 
guild issue them right away.

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:56.790
What?!

00:05:57.250 --> 00:05:59.500
Wh-What did you just say?!

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:00.500
Huh?

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:02.780
That's the one place you don't want to go!

00:06:02.780 --> 00:06:05.590
No matter what happens, 
stay true to yourself!

00:06:05.590 --> 00:06:06.260
Huh?

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:08.720
If anything goes down, you come to me!

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:10.180
I'll lend you an ear!

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:13.820
Whatever you do, don't make 
any hasty decisions! Got it?!

00:06:13.820 --> 00:06:15.190
Y-Yes.

00:06:15.190 --> 00:06:16.270
Good!

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:19.430
I'm Claude Schreizer.

00:06:19.430 --> 00:06:21.770
Feel free to just call me Claude.

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:23.790
I'll do that, then.

00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:26.280
I'm Seiichi. Nice to meet you.

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:28.950
I'm Saria! Nice to meet you!

00:06:28.950 --> 00:06:29.780
Yeah!

00:06:30.190 --> 00:06:32.740
I'm more than happy to get 
to know beautiful women.

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:34.540
So then, once again...

00:06:36.530 --> 00:06:39.580
Welcome to the royal capital, Telbert!

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:54.400
So this is the guild?

00:06:54.400 --> 00:06:59.790
Yeah. It seems like a normal 
place, despite what Claude said.

00:06:59.790 --> 00:07:01.690
What an exaggeration.

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:03.510
Come on, come on, come on!

00:07:03.510 --> 00:07:05.730
You perverted, masochistic pigs!

00:07:05.730 --> 00:07:07.920
Cry out with your plebeian voices!

00:07:09.190 --> 00:07:11.200
Don't act spoiled!

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:14.190
More, please, Queen!

00:07:15.740 --> 00:07:19.140
Yeah, this is the guild.

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:22.220
What's the matter? Aren't we going in?

00:07:22.220 --> 00:07:22.830
Huh?

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:25.210
Y-Yeah, just hold on a second.

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:29.150
Come on, come on, come on!

00:07:29.150 --> 00:07:31.650
Give me an even more vulgar cry!

00:07:31.650 --> 00:07:33.210
Hot! Hot!

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:34.720
Thank you so much!

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:37.080
Damn!

00:07:38.660 --> 00:07:40.460
Anything will do.

00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:43.760
Just let me destroy something!

00:07:47.190 --> 00:07:49.720
He's wost it again.

00:07:49.720 --> 00:07:51.620
You should go shtop him.

00:07:51.620 --> 00:07:55.600
No! Today is the perfect day for streaking!

00:07:55.600 --> 00:07:59.980
If I got into a fist fight and got blood 
on my briefs, that just wouldn't do!

00:07:59.980 --> 00:08:01.210
Twue.

00:08:01.430 --> 00:08:04.160
<i>It's a gathering of perverts!</i>

00:08:04.930 --> 00:08:07.490
Hey, what's going on inside?

00:08:08.930 --> 00:08:10.140
The sight will taint you!

00:08:10.140 --> 00:08:13.840
Let's just move on! We should be able to 
get proof of identification elsewhere.

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:16.470
There's no need for that!

00:08:17.160 --> 00:08:19.520
It's a new type of pervert!

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:22.010
That's right, I'm...

00:08:22.010 --> 00:08:25.300
Guild Master, Guscle Clute!

00:08:25.300 --> 00:08:27.480
Abdominal and thigh!

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:29.510
<i>This is the guild master?!</i>

00:08:29.510 --> 00:08:32.490
<i>He's just some dude who 
thinks muscles are great!</i>

00:08:32.880 --> 00:08:34.890
I heard what you need!

00:08:34.890 --> 00:08:37.990
You're welcome to come 
register with our guild!

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:41.880
Go on! Go on! Go on!

00:08:41.880 --> 00:08:44.710
Go on! Go on!

00:08:43.670 --> 00:08:44.710
Hey! Wait!

00:08:44.710 --> 00:08:45.770
Guscle!

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:51.370
Eris-kun!

00:08:51.370 --> 00:08:53.580
We have the first new applicant in a while!

00:08:55.970 --> 00:09:00.010
Oh, dear. This outfit isn't 
fit for receptionist work.

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:07.250
I'm sorry you two had to 
witness such a shameful sight.

00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:11.020
I'm Eris McClain, the one in 
charge of reception here.

00:09:11.270 --> 00:09:13.260
Wow, so cute!

00:09:13.260 --> 00:09:14.780
Her range is incredible.

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:18.450
Seiichi-san, is that correct?

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:21.000
If you'd like to register with our guild,

00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:23.790
you must have your own reasons.

00:09:25.530 --> 00:09:26.780
<i>True...</i>

00:09:26.780 --> 00:09:29.040
<i>If I want to see everyone else...</i>

00:09:29.350 --> 00:09:32.140
Our guild headquarters here collects

00:09:32.140 --> 00:09:34.810
all kinds of information 
from around the world,

00:09:34.810 --> 00:09:37.300
so if you register, I'm sure 
it'll be to your benefit.

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:40.300
Seiichi!

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:41.590
Saria?

00:09:41.970 --> 00:09:45.500
I think we should register with this guild!

00:09:45.500 --> 00:09:46.360
Huh?

00:09:46.360 --> 00:09:47.810
I mean...

00:09:51.210 --> 00:09:54.190
They all look they're having so much fun.

00:09:54.740 --> 00:09:55.900
All right.

00:09:55.900 --> 00:09:58.200
We'll join this guild, then.

00:09:58.200 --> 00:10:01.620
Oh! I knew you would say that!

00:10:11.400 --> 00:10:13.060
Haven't seen you here before.

00:10:13.060 --> 00:10:14.770
You new here?

00:10:14.770 --> 00:10:17.410
I just joined this guild.

00:10:18.520 --> 00:10:19.700
I see.

00:10:19.700 --> 00:10:21.270
Come with us for a bit.

00:10:21.270 --> 00:10:22.480
Seiichi...

00:10:23.320 --> 00:10:25.280
Saria, you wait here.

00:10:25.280 --> 00:10:26.980
I'll finish this up quick.

00:10:26.980 --> 00:10:28.980
B-But...

00:10:42.790 --> 00:10:45.240
First, show us your damn face!

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:49.090
Whoa...

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:51.000
Hot guy...

00:10:54.120 --> 00:10:55.630
Shall we do it?

00:10:57.820 --> 00:11:00.160
It only hurts at first.

00:11:00.160 --> 00:11:02.140
Once you get used to it, it's fine.

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:05.890
It's our own little welcome party for you!

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:09.000
<i>This is too high-level for a virgin like me!</i>

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:10.140
No!

00:11:10.140 --> 00:11:14.620
Please let me go!

00:11:12.200 --> 00:11:13.150
Wait!

00:11:18.540 --> 00:11:19.290
Hey!

00:11:19.290 --> 00:11:20.600
Don't hold back!

00:11:20.600 --> 00:11:23.310
You'll enjoy life twice as much!

00:11:23.310 --> 00:11:25.160
I'm good, thanks!

00:11:27.310 --> 00:11:29.850
What incredible jumps and speed.

00:11:30.170 --> 00:11:32.310
Such strong legs and loins.

00:11:32.310 --> 00:11:35.170
That's exactly the kind of 
new man we're looking for!

00:11:37.440 --> 00:11:38.920
I'm back.

00:11:40.570 --> 00:11:43.430
Thank goodness you're safe!

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:46.180
Yeah, I'm fine now.

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:50.710
I can't believe you made it back safely.

00:11:50.710 --> 00:11:53.570
Yes, you're the first one to do so.

00:11:53.570 --> 00:11:54.730
Seriously?!

00:11:55.040 --> 00:11:58.320
Hey, Guscle! Do something about those three!

00:11:58.320 --> 00:12:02.190
They're all doing what they 
believe is best, though!

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:05.320
Don't laugh it off!

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:08.980
Anyway, we'd like you two to 
take a few tests for us now.

00:12:08.980 --> 00:12:09.830
Huh?

00:12:10.090 --> 00:12:13.030
Well, they're only really tests in name.

00:12:13.380 --> 00:12:17.490
It's actually a way to assess 
what kinds of quests are suited

00:12:17.490 --> 00:12:19.590
to an applicant's abilities.

00:12:19.590 --> 00:12:20.540
Yeah!

00:12:20.540 --> 00:12:23.380
Most of the quests this guild 
gets are defeating things,

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:26.060
gathering things, odd jobs, 
and guard missions,

00:12:26.060 --> 00:12:28.600
so we assess your abilities in each field.

00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:30.000
I see.

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:31.600
So that's how it works.

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:35.910
However, you're required to have 
a B-Rank or higher adventurer

00:12:35.910 --> 00:12:38.110
accompany you as your test proctor.

00:12:38.110 --> 00:12:40.470
Right now, we only have one of those.

00:12:40.470 --> 00:12:42.740
I bet it's gonna be another unique charac—

00:12:45.560 --> 00:12:46.840
What the hell?

00:12:46.840 --> 00:12:49.120
You actually selected me for this?

00:12:49.820 --> 00:12:52.620
That's the A-Rank adventurer, Artoria.

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:54.180
I already told you, didn't I?

00:12:54.180 --> 00:12:57.130
I refuse to proctor any tests.

00:12:59.260 --> 00:13:01.630
Seiichi, your face...

00:13:02.770 --> 00:13:04.070
Hey, newbie!

00:13:04.070 --> 00:13:07.640
You don't want me as your 
test proctor either, right?

00:13:07.640 --> 00:13:10.140
Huh? Well, I don't really care...

00:13:12.890 --> 00:13:14.890
Are you insane?!

00:13:15.150 --> 00:13:18.100
I understand how you feel, but...

00:13:18.100 --> 00:13:19.400
Shut up!

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:23.160
He was able to escape 
safely from the Mohawks,

00:13:23.160 --> 00:13:26.150
so he might be able to 
survive your predisposition.

00:13:26.150 --> 00:13:27.660
Predisposition?

00:13:27.660 --> 00:13:30.770
What are you even basing 
that suggestion on?!

00:13:30.770 --> 00:13:31.910
Well, that's...

00:13:31.910 --> 00:13:34.520
my muscles, obviously!

00:13:34.520 --> 00:13:37.710
My muscles are the greatest reason!

00:13:38.420 --> 00:13:40.920
<i>I don't understand anything here.</i>

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:42.510
Ugh, damn it!

00:13:42.510 --> 00:13:44.070
Fine, then!

00:13:44.070 --> 00:13:47.180
If you're that insistent, 
then I'll take on the job.

00:13:49.210 --> 00:13:51.450
And, uh, you know...

00:13:51.450 --> 00:13:54.060
Sorry... about earlier.

00:13:54.770 --> 00:13:56.780
I'm Artoria Gremm...

00:13:57.190 --> 00:13:59.400
Artoria, the Calamity.

00:14:04.440 --> 00:14:06.400
So about the tests...

00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:08.910
First, we'll take on quests for odd jobs.

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:10.180
Odd jobs?

00:14:10.180 --> 00:14:11.700
We have three kinds.

00:14:11.700 --> 00:14:16.710
Help out an orphanage, 
demolish a building, and walk a dog.

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:20.390
They really are just odd jobs.

00:14:20.390 --> 00:14:22.410
Normally we'd only do one,

00:14:22.410 --> 00:14:23.710
but that stupid Guscle

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:27.470
probably dumped the unpopular ones on us.

00:14:28.340 --> 00:14:30.180
Hm? What is it?

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:32.720
Well, you're cute when you smile.

00:14:33.970 --> 00:14:35.700
I thought so, too!

00:14:35.700 --> 00:14:37.980
Artoria-san, you're so cute!

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:41.480
Quit spouting stupid crap 
and let's get moving!

00:14:47.270 --> 00:14:50.710
Seiichi, is it okay if I do this quest?

00:14:50.710 --> 00:14:52.990
Will you be okay, though?

00:14:52.990 --> 00:14:54.370
Leave it to me!

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:56.590
I'm an expert at this stuff!

00:14:56.590 --> 00:14:58.510
I can work hard, too!

00:14:58.930 --> 00:15:02.460
Hardly anyone would accept it 
since the reward was so low.

00:15:02.900 --> 00:15:04.250
You're a big help.

00:15:04.520 --> 00:15:05.760
I'll do my best!

00:15:05.760 --> 00:15:08.010
Everyone, it's nice to meet you!

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:17.350
Um, why are you walking 
so far ahead of everyone?

00:15:19.640 --> 00:15:20.270
Wait!

00:15:25.570 --> 00:15:27.530
It hurts!

00:15:28.050 --> 00:15:29.030
Are you o—

00:15:29.030 --> 00:15:31.380
Come on, don't cry.

00:15:32.540 --> 00:15:34.810
Ah, that looks painful.

00:15:34.810 --> 00:15:36.030
Hold on a sec.

00:15:38.260 --> 00:15:39.820
This will sting a bit.

00:15:40.420 --> 00:15:41.200
Ow!

00:15:41.660 --> 00:15:42.790
I'm okay now.

00:15:46.450 --> 00:15:47.800
Artoria-san!

00:15:50.640 --> 00:15:52.000
<i>A defense skill?!</i>

00:15:52.000 --> 00:15:54.970
<i>It's almost as if she anticipated 
that from the beginning.</i>

00:15:56.890 --> 00:15:59.820
I'm just no good.

00:15:59.820 --> 00:16:01.560
Lady?

00:16:06.420 --> 00:16:09.440
The second quest is demolishing a building.

00:16:09.440 --> 00:16:11.570
So where should we... start...

00:16:12.250 --> 00:16:13.140
Hey!

00:16:14.280 --> 00:16:16.570
I should break this here, then?

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:18.830
Huh?

00:16:21.730 --> 00:16:22.820
You dumbass!

00:16:38.740 --> 00:16:42.100
<i>Once again, someone else is 
suffering a tragedy because of me.</i>

00:16:42.550 --> 00:16:45.380
<i>I've always had this predisposition, 
ever since I was child.</i>

00:16:46.500 --> 00:16:49.110
<i>It always affects everyone around me.</i>

00:16:49.400 --> 00:16:52.920
<i>Which is why I can never rely on anyone else,</i>

00:16:52.920 --> 00:16:55.860
<i>and I decided to live by myself.</i>

00:16:55.860 --> 00:16:57.850
Damn it! Damn it!

00:16:57.850 --> 00:16:59.540
<i>I knew this would happen.</i>

00:16:59.860 --> 00:17:01.830
<i>I'm Artoria, the Calamity.</i>

00:17:04.870 --> 00:17:07.030
<i>Everyone who gets involved with me</i>

00:17:07.030 --> 00:17:08.920
<i>suffers calamities, without exception.</i>

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:16.380
Huh?

00:17:19.820 --> 00:17:21.490
Dust got in my mouth.

00:17:26.640 --> 00:17:28.300
You dumbass!

00:17:28.300 --> 00:17:31.110
Don't go acting on your own 
without waiting for directions!

00:17:31.110 --> 00:17:31.900
Huh?

00:17:31.900 --> 00:17:32.870
Listen!

00:17:32.870 --> 00:17:36.350
The job you're aiming for is adventurer!

00:17:36.350 --> 00:17:39.290
In this line of work, selfish actions 
can get a whole party killed!

00:17:39.290 --> 00:17:41.040
Do you understand that?!

00:17:41.370 --> 00:17:42.910
I...

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:47.550
An adventurer doesn't need 
the greatest might or magic!

00:17:47.550 --> 00:17:49.920
They need the ability to sense danger!

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:51.920
Right...

00:17:51.920 --> 00:17:54.580
There's no point in anything if you die!

00:17:54.990 --> 00:17:56.040
Besides...

00:17:56.420 --> 00:17:58.680
You have Saria to worry about!

00:17:58.680 --> 00:18:00.780
I-I'm sorry.

00:18:04.580 --> 00:18:06.740
Well, I may be strict about that,

00:18:07.330 --> 00:18:09.690
but this time I'm partly at fault, too.

00:18:10.130 --> 00:18:12.370
Anyway, I'm glad you're safe.

00:18:16.800 --> 00:18:18.690
Th-There's nothing else, okay?!

00:18:18.690 --> 00:18:20.950
Come on, let's hurry on to the next one.

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:27.940
<i>She might actually be a really kind person.</i>

00:18:32.570 --> 00:18:34.880
It's been five months already?

00:18:35.540 --> 00:18:37.470
Things never go well, do they?

00:18:37.470 --> 00:18:40.330
You were tough on them during training today.

00:18:41.920 --> 00:18:43.030
Why is that?

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:45.860
Because I don't want them to die.

00:18:45.860 --> 00:18:46.470
Huh?

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:49.800
They have nothing to do with our war.

00:18:49.800 --> 00:18:53.600
Yet we're asking them to 
defeat the Demon Lord?

00:18:53.600 --> 00:18:55.580
I just can't agree with that.

00:18:56.200 --> 00:18:57.400
That's...

00:18:58.950 --> 00:18:59.970
Orphe...

00:19:01.180 --> 00:19:02.910
You're the only one I'd say this to.

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:05.490
I'm against this war with the demons.

00:19:05.960 --> 00:19:07.300
That's not good!

00:19:07.300 --> 00:19:09.500
If anyone heard you say that...

00:19:10.310 --> 00:19:12.860
I don't want to let a single one of them die.

00:19:12.860 --> 00:19:15.080
If they came here from a peaceful world,

00:19:15.080 --> 00:19:18.510
I wish they could have gone on 
living in that wonderful place.

00:19:23.610 --> 00:19:26.900
The final trial is just walking a dog.

00:19:26.900 --> 00:19:28.880
It'll be a piece of cake, then.

00:19:32.910 --> 00:19:34.940
This is a wolf!

00:19:35.520 --> 00:19:38.530
Huh?!

00:19:38.530 --> 00:19:42.530
Seiichi-san and Milk-chan look like 
they're having an awful lot of fun.

00:19:42.530 --> 00:19:44.780
Are you kidding me?!

00:19:45.190 --> 00:19:46.190
Seiichi!

00:19:46.190 --> 00:19:49.790
If it looks like you're really in danger, 
I'll rescue you, so don't worry!

00:19:49.790 --> 00:19:52.540
You're definitely not saving me, then!

00:19:52.540 --> 00:19:56.290
Still, Artoria-chan, you've changed.

00:19:56.290 --> 00:19:57.340
Huh?

00:19:57.340 --> 00:19:59.650
Well, you're smiling more than you used to.

00:19:59.650 --> 00:20:01.550
Maybe it's because of him?

00:20:01.550 --> 00:20:04.160
O-Of course it's not!

00:20:04.160 --> 00:20:06.150
I'm just acting as their test proctor

00:20:06.150 --> 00:20:07.810
b-because I have to!

00:20:08.120 --> 00:20:10.590
My, my, is that so?

00:20:13.560 --> 00:20:17.950
Here is your reward for 
completing these quests!

00:20:18.630 --> 00:20:20.580
Where did you just pull that from?!

00:20:20.580 --> 00:20:21.530
All right!

00:20:21.530 --> 00:20:23.360
Now get some good rest!

00:20:23.360 --> 00:20:26.070
Rest is important for muscles, too, you know!

00:20:26.300 --> 00:20:28.830
By the way, do you have an inn to stay at?

00:20:29.270 --> 00:20:30.660
Now that you mention it...

00:20:31.830 --> 00:20:33.330
Guess we'll just camp out.

00:20:33.700 --> 00:20:36.170
But your bodies won't be properly rested.

00:20:36.170 --> 00:20:37.590
Um...

00:20:37.590 --> 00:20:39.740
I-If you need a place,

00:20:39.740 --> 00:20:42.090
how about the inn I'm staying at?

00:20:43.820 --> 00:20:45.580
What did you say?!

00:20:43.820 --> 00:20:45.590
What?!

00:20:45.580 --> 00:20:47.740
W-Well, you know.

00:20:47.740 --> 00:20:49.590
I figured it would be more, um...

00:20:49.590 --> 00:20:51.430
The rate's reasonable, too.

00:20:51.430 --> 00:20:53.100
And the food's good.

00:20:53.100 --> 00:20:55.450
Our Artoria-san is...

00:20:55.450 --> 00:20:58.860
M-My pecs are stunned!

00:20:59.120 --> 00:21:01.610
I-I won't force you to!

00:21:02.380 --> 00:21:04.110
Please let us!

00:21:06.840 --> 00:21:08.970
<i>A lot happened today,</i>

00:21:09.460 --> 00:21:14.380
<i>but I think we've found some hope 
for a steady life in our future.</i>

