<b>Skills:
 Attack: Guillotine Kick. Twin Fang Attack. Adamant Claws.
 Resistance: Paralysis Resistance. Sleep Resistance. Confusion Resistance.
 Charm Resistance. Petrification Resistance. Bind Resistance.
