Tool Creation (Superior).</b>

00:23:07.020 --> 00:23:09.140
Hey, what is this "Compress"?

00:23:09.140 --> 00:23:12.290
It's a skill that allows 
him to compress anything.

00:23:12.290 --> 00:23:16.600
He can compress his own body, even his 
power, and basically anything else.

00:23:16.600 --> 00:23:20.430
However, he has to touch 
whatever he wishes to compress.

00:23:20.430 --> 00:23:25.720
Then what would happen if he touched 
your boobs with this Compress skill?

00:23:25.720 --> 00:23:26.420
Wha—

00:23:27.670 --> 00:23:29.190
B-Boobs...

00:23:29.190 --> 00:23:31.130
Don't stare at them!

00:23:31.560 --> 00:23:34.970
I-I wasn't staring that hard.

00:23:35.850 --> 00:23:37.720
While continuing our tests 
to become adventurers,

00:23:37.720 --> 00:23:39.760
we get teleported into a mysterious dungeon!

00:23:39.760 --> 00:23:41.100
There we find the legendary dragon said to be

00:23:41.100 --> 00:23:43.100
the strongest member of 
the Demon Lord's army!

00:23:43.000 --> 00:23:50.250
<b>Next Time
Black Dragon God's Dungeon</b>

00:23:43.340 --> 00:23:45.980
Next time: "Black Dragon God's Dungeon."

00:23:45.980 --> 00:23:48.450
Artoria-san!
